    "title": "Back in the Saddle: River Oaks Football staff grows stronger with addition of experience - NewsBreak",
    "text": "MONROE, La. ( KTVE/KARD ) — The River Oaks Mustangs are back on the field at fall camp preparing for the 2025 season. But this year, the players aren’t the only ones getting back into the groove of things. Bo Barton made some unique additions to his coaching staff—additions that bring experience, knowledge and the will to win. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KTVE - myarklamiss.com.",
